used on discovery and decryption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short gameplay experience ideal for a single intense session.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693360/extras/GitG_Code.gif?t=1746637429\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ghost In The Grid combines elements of adventure, puzzle-solving, and hacking mechanics within a compact cyberpunk story. With guidance from your operator, you'll gradually uncover lost messages, decrypt systems, and unveil the hidden secrets of the city.</p>","developers":["Luc2as Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693360/af37c9f96df8ee8254c80352528c3afd1e3d8584/header.jpg?t=1746637429","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129642,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129642/movie480.mp4?t=1746090415","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129642/movie_max.mp4?t=1746090415"},"name":"Ghost In The Grid - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257129642/9893bd1e3a17ed093401d6a625445fd0efe04cd5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746090415","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129642/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746090415","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129642/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746090415"}}],"name":"Ghost In The Grid","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 - 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or new-gen i3 / AMD equivalent<br></l